{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"8622a749-2dd6-40c0-b785-01d82e6085fd","description":"Find information on completing the other UK income section of your Self Assessment tax return.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>You may need to declare other UK income on your self assessment tax return, including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>interest from securities</li>\n  <li>life insurance gains</li>\n  <li>share schemes</li>\n  <li>employment lump sums</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>If you own shares in a company and have received a dividend payment, you can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/tax-on-dividends/how-to-report-tax-on-dividends\">check how to report them on your Self Assessment tax return</a>.</p>\n\n<p>If your employer has offered you company shares as a reward for working for them,  you can find out if you’ll need to pay <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/tax-employee-share-schemes\">tax on Employee Share Schemes</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information that can help you complete different sections of your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"employment-related-shares-and-securities\">Employment-related shares and securities</h3>\n\n<p>Find out how to work out the taxable amount on your <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/employee-shares-and-securities-further-guidance-hs305-self-assessment-helpsheet\">employment-related shares and securities (HS305)</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"gains-on-uk-life-insurance-policies\">Gains on UK life insurance policies</h3>\n\n<p>If you have <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/gains-on-uk-life-insurance-policies-hs320-self-assessment-helpsheet\">gains on UK life insurance policies (HS320)</a>, you can find out:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>who should report the gain on the UK life insurance policy</li>\n  <li>how to report the gain</li>\n  <li>if you are entitled to any reliefs</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"accrued-income-scheme\">Accrued Income Scheme</h3>\n\n<p>Use the helpsheet on the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/accrued-income-scheme-hs343-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Accrued Income Scheme (HS343)</a> to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>decide if the Accrued Income Scheme applies to you</li>\n  <li>work out your accrued income profits or losses if the scheme does apply</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"other-taxable-income-for-self-assessment\">Other taxable income for Self Assessment</h3>\n\n<p>If you have <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/other-taxable-income-hs325-self-assessment-helpsheet\">other taxable income (HS325)</a> you can work out any tax you need to pay on income such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>casual earnings</li>\n  <li>commission</li>\n  <li>freelance income</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"hmrc-youtube-video\">HMRC YouTube video</h2>\n\n<p>Watch a recorded webinar about other income and tax reliefs on your online tax return.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DvYwU6l_w3M\">Other income and tax reliefs on your online tax return</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about other income, such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>UK interest</li>\n  <li>dividend income</li>\n  <li>state pensions</li>\n  <li>High Income Child Benefit Charge</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The YouTube webinar about other income and tax reliefs has been updated.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-11T08:15:41Z"},{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2025-04-22T23:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2025-04-23T00:00:00.000+01:00","headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"employment-related-shares-and-securities","level":3,"text":"Employment-related shares and securities"},{"id":"gains-on-uk-life-insurance-policies","level":3,"text":"Gains on UK life insurance policies"},{"id":"accrued-income-scheme","level":3,"text":"Accrued Income Scheme"},{"id":"other-taxable-income-for-self-assessment","level":3,"text":"Other taxable income for Self Assessment"}],"id":"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return","level":2,"text":"Helpsheets for filling in your tax return"},{"id":"hmrc-youtube-video","level":2,"text":"HMRC YouTube video"}],"political":false,"related_mainstream_content":[],"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"detailed_guide","first_published_at":"2025-04-23T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","content_id":"8622a749-2dd6-40c0-b785-01d82e6085fd","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"cy","public_updated_at":"2025-09-11T08:15:41Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Cael help gydag incwm arall y DU ar eich Ffurflen Dreth Hunanasesiad","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"8622a749-2dd6-40c0-b785-01d82e6085fd","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-09-11T08:15:41Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Help with other UK income on your Self Assessment tax return","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/help-with-other-uk-income-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","withdrawn":false}],"document_collections":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/get-help-filling-in-your-self-assessm